text = "Aim: E (up) and C (down) for Player 1, I (up) and Comma (down) for Player 2.
Hold Punch to charge a smash. Aim + Punch: up, down and side attacks.
Up + Punch in the air: recovery jump, once per airtime. Down while falling: fast fall.
Fall past a table end to grab the leg: Up climbs, Jump ledge-jumps, Down lets go, Punch attacks.
Double jump: Jump again. Dash: double-tap a direction. Esc or Start: pause."
